    "type": "mc",
    "prompt": "Several different points are marked on a line, and all possible line segments are constructed between pairs of these points. One of these points lies on exactly 80 of these segments (not including any segments of which this point is an endpoint). Another one of these points lies on exactly 90 segments (not including any segments of which it is an endpoint). How many points are marked on the line?",
