        "text": "85"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "90"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Count segments through a point",
        "body": "A point with $a$ points on its left and $b$ on its right lies strictly inside $ab$ segments, and the total number of points is $a+b+1$. We need $ab=80$ and $cd=90$ with $a+b=c+d$. Factor pairs of 80 have sums 81, 42, 24, 21, 18; of 90 have sums 91, 47, 33, 23, 21, 19. The common sum is 21 (from $5\\times16$ and $6\\times15$), so there are $21+1=22$ points.\n\n**Answer: (B) 22**"
      }
    ],
